                        "text": "The attribute android:allowBackup is deprecated from Android 12 and may be removed in future versions. Consider adding the attribute android:dataExtractionRules specifying an @xml resource which configures backups and device transfers on Android 12 and higher.",
                        "markdown": "The attribute `android:allowBackup` is deprecated from Android 12 and may be removed in future versions. Consider adding the attribute `android:dataExtractionRules` specifying an `@xml` resource which configures backups and device transfers on Android 12 and higher."
